OL,3,GNEWSAStar Wars cosplayers bring the
OL,4,AForce to Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs an army of customers swarms shopping
OL,7,Fcentres on a weekend, a very different
OL,8,Fkind of army waits around the corner.
OL,10,FThe ominous, mechanical breathing of
OL,11,FDarth Vader can be heard in the
OL,12,Fdistance before he appears flanked by
OL,13,Fstormtroopers.
OL,15,FThey are members of the Phoenix Squad,
OL,16,Fa Star Wars costuming group that
OL,17,Fappears at events around Yorkshire.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
