OL,3,GNEWSAStar Wars cosplayers bring the
OL,4,AForce to Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver Halloween weekend, they visited
OL,7,Fthe Ridings Shopping Centre, in
OL,8,FWakefield, while other recent
OL,9,Fengagements have included Flemingate,
OL,10,Fin Beverley, the Broadway, in Bradford,
OL,11,Fand Lakeside Village, Doncaster.
